        "body": "<p>Your skin is a living surface with its own microbiome, the community of microbes that helps keep it healthy. The research points steadily in one direction. Skin tends to do better when that community is supported rather than stripped. So we formulate to nourish it, with prebiotics, postbiotics and cold-pressed oils, and we leave synthetic fragrance out entirely.</p>",
